WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.747
Pig ran to the clover.

2
00:00:07.748 --> 00:00:10.943
He oinked at the bees.

3
00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:14.048
The bees buzzed.

4
00:00:14.049 --> 00:00:17.170
Pig oinked some more.

5
00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:20.242
The bees buzzed some more.

6
00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:25.759
Pig blew on them.

7
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.811
The bees buzzed and buzzed.

8
00:00:30.812 --> 00:00:35.219
Pig huffed and puffed.

9
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.925
He oinked and blew.

10
00:00:39.926 --> 00:00:50.972
He ran around the bees.

11
00:00:50.973 --> 00:00:54.548
The bees buzzed around Pig.

12
00:00:54.549 --> 00:00:59.430
They landed on his face.

13
00:00:59.431 --> 00:01:03.515
Then one big bee stung Pig.

14
00:01:03.516 --> 00:01:07.051
It stung him right on his nose!

15
00:01:07.052 --> 00:01:14.051
"Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!" said Pig.

16
00:01:14.052 --> 00:01:17.426
"Oh no, Pig!" said Cow.

17
00:01:17.427 --> 00:01:19.418
"Did that hurt?"

18
00:01:19.419 --> 00:01:22.691
"Yes!" said Pig.

19
00:01:22.692 --> 00:01:27.142
He ran to the pond.

20
00:01:27.143 --> 00:01:34.444
He put his nose in the mud.

21
00:01:34.445 --> 00:01:38.371
"Thank you, Super Pig!" said Cow.

22
00:01:38.372 --> 00:01:43.669
"All the bees are gone.

23
00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:50.581
And the clover is very good!"

